      create    db/migrate/20250820180520_create_lesson_topics.rb
amb@ctd1:~/ctdapp$ 


10.- Inside the create_table block, add associations to topics and lessons with t.references :topic and t.references :lesson

amb@ctd1:~/ctdapp/db/migrate$ cat 20250820180520_create_lesson_topics.rb
class CreateLessonTopics < ActiveRecord::Migration[8.0]
  def change
    create_table :lesson_topics do |t|
      t.references :topic
      t.references :lesson
      
      t.timestamps
    end
  end
end


