12.- If the migration run was successful, create the model for your join table (be sure the name matches Rails conventions).

amb@ctd1:~/ctdapp/app/models$ cat lesson_topic.rb 
class LessonTopic < ApplicationRecord
  belongs_to :lesson
  belongs_to :topic

  has_many :topics
  has_many :lessons
end


